m with multiple Shadowy Statues with texts:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Master Eliphas,  First Circle Master of the Black Sphinx</li>\n<li>Mistral the Beautiful, Second Circle Master of the Black Sphinx</li>\n<li>Maeve the Dark Serpent, Third Circle Master of the Black Sphinx</li>\n<li>Ewart the Cold-Hearted, Fourth Circle Master of the Black Sphinx</li></ul>\n<p>During early tests on the Test Servers for the Winter Update 2016 <a href=\"#/wiki/Black%20Knight\">Black Knights</a> spawned in this dungeon by mistake. This caused controversy and they were quickly removed, to keep the black knight a unique spawn and keep its lore intact.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Upper floors</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\"><img alt=\"Necromancer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Necromancer_358a21.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">580</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">580</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">328 (<span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">80 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></s